# The restaurant's own details, baked into the front-end at build time.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_.

# GSTIN printed on every customer bill.
# LEFT BLANK DELIBERATELY: the restaurant has not been issued one yet. While it
# is blank the receipt simply omits the line — a bill showing "GSTIN: ______"
# looks unfinished to a customer, and an invented number would be worse.
# When the number arrives, put it here and rebuild:
#   VITE_RESTAURANT_GSTIN=29ABCDE1234F1Z5
VITE_RESTAURANT_GSTIN=
